title: Authorizations › Case page › Risk analysis
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=risk
intro: The fourth tab: how often similar requests were approved, why the chance is what it is, the likely outcomes, how sure Forecaster is, and the two pop-ups behind 'See all' and 'How it is calculated'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the history behind the numbers is generated, and the 'Calibrated' line is fixed text. The sums on the page are real: the rows always add up to the chance now.
---
start s1 "Click 'Risk analysis'"
screen rk "Risk analysis\nHistorical outcomes of similar requests"
screen h "Card 'Historical outcomes'\n'Summit Medicaid HMO · Residential 3.5 admission'\n'Matched on' chips: Payer and plan, Level of care, Diagnosis cluster, Review type, Documentation signals"
decision dB "Fewer than 100 similar cases from you and the network?"
toast bp "Pill 'Benchmark estimate' on the card"
screen bg "Red card 'Biggest driver of a short approval'\n'No named step-down provider' and how often it was seen"
screen cm "Green card 'What the approved cases had in common'\nFour ticked lines"

screen wn "Card 'Why this number'\nFormula such as '58 + 4 + 6 + 2 + 0 + 0 − 8 = 62'\nPill 'Moderate · 62%'"
process bars "Bars: the starting point, six rows, then 'Approval chance now'\nGreen to the right adds points, terracotta to the left takes them away\nDashed outline: what is still to come"
screen lo "Card 'Likely outcomes'\nDonut and list: 'Approved as asked' 62%, 'Partly approved' 25%, 'Denied' 13%"
screen hs "Card 'How sure are we'\nLikely range '57–66%' and a bar of yours, network and benchmark cases"
screen cd "Card 'Comparable decisions'\nThree rows: 'Yours' or 'Network', match, outcome pill"
click sa "Click 'See all'"
screen ct "Card 'Can you trust it?' with pill 'Calibrated'\n'Forecaster said 80 to 90% for similar Summit requests. 86% were approved in full, across 214 decisions.'\n'Checked every night against what payers actually decided.'"
click hc "Click 'How it is calculated'"

decision dOp "Are any actions still open?"
toast b1 "Banner 'Where this stands: moderate, with 6 steps left. The biggest single step is to name the step-down provider (+11 pts).'"
toast b2 "Banner 'Where this stands: every recommended action is applied. The draft is as strong as the chart allows.'"
process cl "Banner is green at 80+ and amber below"
agent fc "Forecaster re-scores whenever an action is applied\n(demo: the sums are done on the page)"
store ap "Applying an action grows its rows\nTotal, donut, range and banner all move"

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Risk analysis › Pop-ups"

s1 --> rk --> h --> dB
dB -->|Yes| bp
rk --> bg
rk --> cm
rk --> wn --> bars
rk --> lo
rk --> hs
rk --> cd --> sa --> g1
rk --> ct --> hc --> g1
rk --> dOp
dOp -->|Yes| b1 --> cl
dOp -->|No| b2 --> cl
fc -.-> ap
ap -.-> wn
